# Log: Research Agent

## Format
```
[timestamp] [level] [message]
```

## Levels
- INFO: Normal operations
- WARN: Potential issues
- ERROR: Errors requiring attention

## Log Rotation
- Daily rotation
- Keep 30 days
- Archive old logs

## Example Entries
```
2026-07-27T10:00:00Z INFO Research started: Himalayan biodiversity
2026-07-27T10:15:00Z INFO Research completed: Digital library best practices
2026-07-27T10:30:00Z WARN Source credibility issue
2026-07-27T10:45:00Z ERROR Research failed: Access denied
```
